  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=130%><b><color=#ffd970>AREA 3 - FOG & ATMOSPHERE</color></b></size>

    A
    misty swamp: <b>fog modes</b>, fog that <b>thickens</b> as you walk deeper, and
    a <b>post-processing Volume</b> (colour grading, Vignette, Bloom) that sets the
    mood.


    <b><color=#9fe3ff>TRY THIS</color></b>

    <size=92%>1. Change the
    Fog Zone''s fog colour to purple. Does it still match the sky?

    2. Switch
    the Volume off with the plate. Which do you prefer?

    3. Set Density At End
    to 0.3 and walk to the hut.</size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
